{
    "version": 6,
    "bundle": "PFGFIKLLRJ3NJIJK6PR7MA7RD2TI2TKO",
    "type": "story",
    "storyId": "041141003",
    "title": "運命の声を信じろ！",
    "enTitle": "Believe in the Voice of Fate!",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "はぁ……っ、はぁ……っ。\n……っ。",
            "enText": "Haa…… haa…… \n……",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "origClipLength": 198,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（エピ……）",
                    "enText": "(Epi……)",
                    "nextBlock": 2
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 225,
                    "pathId": 4386050753913063505
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -1652698943165561016
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 209,
                    "pathId": -7898744939046692338
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5614144949633632942,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "彼女は負けた。道中、一度も抑えることなく突っ走った結果、\n体力が持たず……あっという間に差し切られてしまった――完敗だ。",
            "enText": "She had lost. After running at full speed without \nholding back, she had run out of stamina……in the \nblink of an eye she was overtaken――an utter defeat.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "origClipLength": 123,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 165,
                    "pathId": -7794867890393736999
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 209,
                    "pathId": -2004819000514526068
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 228375311000299382,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シンボリクリスエス",
            "enName": "Symboli Kris S",
            "jpText": "Running wild――猛るままでは、勝てない。\nNot just against me……全てに、だ。",
            "enText": "Running wild――By running so unrestrained, you cannot win. \nNot just against me……against anyone.",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "origClipLength": 354,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 196,
                    "pathId": -353581613172423122
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 26,
                    "pathId": 8713283847809247634
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 367,
                    "pathId": 554374623636680835
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4753800810115535027,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "…………――",
            "enText": "…………――",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "origClipLength": 105,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "あ……！",
                    "enText": "Ah……!",
                    "nextBlock": 5
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 75,
                    "pathId": -8643421534747803545
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 21,
                    "pathId": 5879653601831583305
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 11,
                    "pathId": 2728165726329488183
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8513854456824123433,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "気がつけば、すっかり日が傾いていた。ここまで前向きな側面しか、\n見てこなかったが……今、彼女はどんなことを感じているのだろう。",
            "enText": "Before I realized it, the sun was setting. Up until now I had only \nseen her upbeat side but……right now, just what was she feeling?",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "origClipLength": 127,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 89,
                    "pathId": -7189707633403195305
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2711878458014510141,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "あれほどの自信を見せていたところを見ると、この敗北は\nショックだったに違いない。それか悔しがっているのか……。",
            "enText": "Considering how confident she had been, this defeat must have come \nas quite the shock. I wonder if she's frustrated because of it……",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "origClipLength": 116,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "エピ……",
                    "enText": "Epi……",
                    "nextBlock": 7
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 166,
                    "pathId": -5934011237900016393
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -5330572806190459037,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "うん！　なんだ！？",
            "enText": "Oh! What's up!?",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "origClipLength": 44,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 89,
                    "pathId": 7713408710243302916
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 126,
                    "pathId": -850816792419752137
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3829333831499460113,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "もう敗北を受け入れ、整理し終えたのだろうか。平然とする彼女に、\n少し驚いたが……であれば、敗因についても話し合えそうだ。",
            "enText": "It almost seems like she had already come to terms with her \nown defeat. Her composure was a little surprising, but…… \nThat made it easier to discuss the reasons for her defeat.",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "origClipLength": 123,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "今回、君が負けてしまったのは……",
                    "enText": "This time, you lost because……",
                    "nextBlock": 9
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "今回、貴方が負けてしまったのは……",
                    "enText": "This time, you lost because……",
                    "nextBlock": 9
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 183,
                    "pathId": 3375148600308896018
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 156,
                    "pathId": 3964640607553628770
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6296912174566648801,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "今じゃなかっただけだ！",
            "enText": "It just means now wasn't the time!",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "origClipLength": 50,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "え？",
                    "enText": "Eh?",
                    "nextBlock": 10
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": -3214104851417050147
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -5650297195627569597
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5262458275857420487,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "アタシは勝つ。必ず勝てる！\nだから今回は、ただ負けただけだ。",
            "enText": "I will win. I will definitely win! \nSo, this time, I just happened to lose.",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "origClipLength": 194,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "いや……だから、その分析を――",
                    "enText": "But……we should probably analyze――",
                    "nextBlock": 11
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 250,
                    "pathId": -4682135133150073142
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": -7401004430578328684
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3514644120253684645,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "必要ない、次は勝てばいい！\n運命の声も必ずそう言うさ！",
            "enText": "There's no need, I just win next time! \nThe Voice of Fate will definitely say that!",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "origClipLength": 186,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "……勢いだけじゃ、結果は変わらないぞ",
                    "enText": "That alone won't change the outcome",
                    "nextBlock": 12
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "……勢いだけじゃ、結果は変わらないよ",
                    "enText": "That alone won't change the outcome",
                    "nextBlock": 12
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 285,
                    "pathId": -951330140369577939
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 45,
                    "pathId": -5776999059844247516
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4762249927626344735,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "変わるさ！　前へ進めば、景色が変わる！\nひたすら進めば、世界だって変えられる！",
            "enText": "It will change! As I continue forward, the scenery will change! \nAs long as I keep moving forward, I can even change the world!",
            "nextBlock": 13,
            "origClipLength": 226,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 236,
                    "pathId": -1713481621454836930
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -5917607785183362928,
            "blockIdx": 12
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "運命に愛されたアタシに、不可能はない！\n明日のアタシは――今日より強い！！",
            "enText": "For someone loved by Fate like me, nothing is impossible! \nTomorrow's me――will be stronger!!",
            "nextBlock": 14,
            "origClipLength": 205,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": 1805243132145849955
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 263701159872010678,
            "blockIdx": 13
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "言葉が出なかった。彼女は本気で勝つ気で格上に挑み、完敗した。\nしかし今もなお、全く自信を失っていない――ただの少しも、だ。",
            "enText": "I couldn't say anything. She challenged a higher ranking \nopponent with the intentions of winning, and was defeated. \nBut even now, she hadn't lost confidence――not even a little.",
            "nextBlock": 15,
            "origClipLength": 124,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（危険な過信だ。なのに……否定できない）",
                    "enText": "(Overconfident. But I couldn't deny it)",
                    "nextBlock": 15
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 207,
                    "pathId": -4663333385359514195
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8337742686857383267,
            "blockIdx": 14
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "……お！　運命の声が聞こえる！\n行くぞー！",
            "enText": "……Oh! I can hear the Voice of Fate! \nLet's go!",
            "nextBlock": 16,
            "origClipLength": 179,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 58,
                    "pathId": -6978307106135538821
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 35,
                    "pathId": 1187801599446374814
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4107498338351038698,
            "blockIdx": 15
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "……運命の声という名の、単なる直感に振り回されているだけだと\n思っていた。間違った結果が出れば、説得できるようなものだと。",
            "enText": "……She called it the Voice of Fate, but I thought it was merely \nintuition. And if it was wrong, that she could pass it off as fate.",
            "nextBlock": 17,
            "origClipLength": 124,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（でも、そんな甘いものじゃなかった）",
                    "enText": "(But it wasn't something so shallow)",
                    "nextBlock": 17
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3541866161382947563,
            "blockIdx": 16
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "彼女の声は、信念そのものだ。彼女は本気で、自分を信じている。\n自分は絶対に正しいというその自信は――けして、揺るがない。",
            "enText": "That voice was her conviction itself. She genuinely \nbelieved. That belief, with absolute certainty, \nthat she was correct――it would never waver.",
            "nextBlock": 18,
            "origClipLength": 123,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（そんな子を……どう導けばいいんだ？）",
                    "enText": "(How should I guide someone like that?)",
                    "nextBlock": 18
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "（そんな子を……どう導けばいいの？）",
                    "enText": "(How should I guide someone like that?)",
                    "nextBlock": 18
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 183455983942402629,
            "blockIdx": 17
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シーザリオ",
            "enName": "Cesario",
            "jpText": "トレーナー。\n……エピさんのこと、追いかけないんですか？",
            "enText": "Trainer. \n……About Epi-san, are you not going to chase her?",
            "nextBlock": 19,
            "origClipLength": 162,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "シーザリオ……",
                    "enText": "Cesario……",
                    "nextBlock": 19
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 186,
                    "pathId": 5889963671360008601
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -8908317923739258080
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3082266380487481324,
            "blockIdx": 18
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シーザリオ",
            "enName": "Cesario",
            "jpText": "邪魔しないように、と思って声こそかけてはいませんでしたが……\nおふたりのこと、こっそり見守っていたんですよ。",
            "enText": "I didn't want to get in the way so I was considering not saying \nanything, but……I've been secretly watching over both of you.",
            "nextBlock": 20,
            "origClipLength": 298,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "……情けないところ、見せちゃったな",
                    "enText": "……Sorry that you saw that.",
                    "nextBlock": 20
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "……情けないところ、見せちゃったね",
                    "enText": "……Sorry that you saw that.",
                    "nextBlock": 20
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 189,
                    "pathId": -2570677904688706130
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7606427214921301678,
            "blockIdx": 19
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シーザリオ",
            "enName": "Cesario",
            "jpText": "そんな……。エピさんは、決めたことには一直線ですから……\n引っ張られてばかりになってしまうのは、私も一緒でした。",
            "enText": "Oh, no…… Epi-san, once she decides on something she goes straight \nfor it……getting dragged along like that, I'm no different.",
            "nextBlock": 21,
            "origClipLength": 353,
            "voiceIdx": 12,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 232,
                    "pathId": -359600426860870273
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 165,
                    "pathId": -5185821316052230547
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 9179280626102386229,
            "blockIdx": 20
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シーザリオ",
            "enName": "Cesario",
            "jpText": "でも、それでも……そんなエピさんだからこそ。私たちは、\n彼女の未来を見たいと思うんでしょうね。……ほら。",
            "enText": "But, even then……it's because Epi-san is that way. That we end \nup wanting to see what the future holds for her, right? ……Look.",
            "nextBlock": 22,
            "origClipLength": 401,
            "voiceIdx": 13,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 290,
                    "pathId": -6107202302081685678
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 49,
                    "pathId": 3953070119339046527
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 2118006177041289005,
            "blockIdx": 21
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "エピファネイアは、先ほど負けたばかりのシンボリクリスエスと\n一緒にトレーニングをしていた。……というより――",
            "enText": "Even though she just lost to Symboli Kris S, Epiphaneia \nwas already training together with her. ……Or rather――",
            "nextBlock": 23,
            "origClipLength": 115,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 50,
                    "pathId": 921184961544650112
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 125,
                    "pathId": 330943201157655707
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 143,
                    "pathId": -243041016663614620
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 10,
                    "pathId": 7530433519449299355
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 10,
                    "pathId": -3412161498924600168
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 2885458478423844811,
            "blockIdx": 22
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "――……っはぁ……はぁ……っ！\n……そうか、クリスエスみたくもっと踏み込めば……――",
            "enText": "――……Haaa……haaa……! \n……I see, so just like Kris S, I need to step in more……――",
            "nextBlock": 24,
            "origClipLength": 307,
            "voiceIdx": 14,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（……一方的に、ついていってる？）",
                    "enText": "(……――She's just tagging along?)",
                    "nextBlock": 24
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 57,
                    "pathId": 859108592109146624
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 151,
                    "pathId": 4924404557730726312
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 322,
                    "pathId": 2660692848853973739
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 24,
                    "pathId": 6201539825769928446
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4722719227182218916,
            "blockIdx": 23
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シーザリオ",
            "enName": "Cesario",
            "jpText": "クリスエスさんは、その背中で。私は言葉も交えて丁寧に……\nふたりで、エピさんを導いてきました。――彼女の運命に惹かれて。",
            "enText": "Kris S, just by being an example. And I, with gentle words…… \nBoth of us, are guiding Epi-san. ――Drawn together by her Fate.",
            "nextBlock": 25,
            "origClipLength": 441,
            "voiceIdx": 15,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "運命……",
                    "enText": "Fate……",
                    "nextBlock": 25
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 57,
                    "pathId": 1625880424902257754
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 102,
                    "pathId": -5698300833468836926
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 10,
                    "pathId": -4670780426326366401
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 463,
                    "pathId": 935670026779536425
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 100,
                    "pathId": -2439824109877291167
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4075453410425195623,
            "blockIdx": 24
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シーザリオ",
            "enName": "Cesario",
            "jpText": "指導を学ぶべく、デビュー前の子に声をかけていた時……\nエピさんが、立候補してくれたんです。――『運命を感じた』って。",
            "enText": "When I was reaching out to girls who hadn't debuted, \ntrying to learn how to instruct……Epi-san volunteered \nherself. ――Saying 『I could feel Fate』",
            "nextBlock": 26,
            "origClipLength": 346,
            "voiceIdx": 16,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 167,
                    "pathId": -6075316987247245621
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 16,
                    "pathId": 2216807406596205515
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 183,
                    "pathId": -5577179183922414872
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -841126141700770387,
            "blockIdx": 25
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シーザリオ",
            "enName": "Cesario",
            "jpText": "最初は戸惑いました。でも、エピさん、私の指導にも一生懸命、\nついてきてくれて……クリスエスさんにも、食らいついていました。",
            "enText": "At first I was confused. But, Epi-san, worked hard to follow \nmy teachings……And with Kris S, she just kept sticking to her.",
            "nextBlock": 27,
            "origClipLength": 362,
            "voiceIdx": 17,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 356,
                    "pathId": -734193283860143904
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 136,
                    "pathId": 1838596521217747892
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": -5380570261058058910
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1741345877586435149,
            "blockIdx": 26
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シーザリオ",
            "enName": "Cesario",
            "jpText": "一度だって折れずに……どんな時も、自分を信じて前へと進む。\nあのとんでもない勢いで、どんな壁も壊していってしまう……。",
            "enText": "Without faltering at all……always believing in herself \nand moving forward. With that incredible drive, \njust how many walls would she smash through……?",
            "nextBlock": 28,
            "origClipLength": 386,
            "voiceIdx": 18,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 243,
                    "pathId": 7560617501797913745
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 173,
                    "pathId": 245887860008659598
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 16,
                    "pathId": 7509253872688984459
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 17,
