        {
            "jpName": "シーザリオ",
            "enName": "Cesario",
            "jpText": "一方的にでは、ないはずです。トレーナーだって、\n何か感じたものがあるから、ここにいるんでしょう？　……今も。",
            "enText": "It shouldn't have been one-sided. Trainer too, you felt \nsomething too, which is why you're here right? ……And even now.",
            "nextBlock": 31,
