            "enText": "The thing I felt from her……It was \"gravitas\". I \nwas drawn by her potential……and her energy……before \nI realized it, I'd already gotten dragged in to it.",
            "nextBlock": 34,
            "origClipLength": 123,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "でも……今のままじゃダメだ",
